# .github/CODEOWNERS
# Write/approval control for the workflow pipeline. GitHub can't restrict READ access per folder.
# Team handles are placeholders (TBC): create the teams in the GitHub org, then replace them.
# The last matching pattern wins.

*                                   @riu-docs/doc-owners

# Process models: business SMEs approve meaning; doc owners approve structure
/workflows/                         @riu-docs/process-smes @riu-docs/doc-owners
/docs/processes/                    @riu-docs/process-smes @riu-docs/doc-owners

# Conformance bindings are owned by the engineering team that implements them
/conformance/                       @riu-docs/engineering @riu-docs/doc-owners
/workflows/consumers.yaml           @riu-docs/engineering @riu-docs/doc-owners

# Rules, schemas, tooling, CI, and agent definitions: governance changes
/governance/                        @riu-docs/doc-owners
/schemas/                           @riu-docs/doc-owners
/tooling/                           @riu-docs/doc-owners
/.github/                           @riu-docs/doc-owners
